  },
  "description": "HTTP error rates classified by protocol. Built on the existing honua_http_request_total counter (emitted by Honua.Core PerformanceMetrics with labels method, endpoint, status_code). Protocol classification is derived from the endpoint label via regex match because the metric does not yet carry a dedicated 'protocol' label; adding one would let these panels group exactly instead of pattern-matching. The OTel ASP.NET Core counterpart (http_server_request_duration_seconds_count, label http_response_status_code) is also exported and can be substituted if route-template granularity is needed. Error-response-shape distribution is a placeholder; see #1144.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "4xx rate per protocol. Protocol is inferred from the endpoint label (e.g. /wms => WMS, /stac => STAC).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "req/s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(honua_http_request_total{status_code=~\"4..\", endpoint=~\".*/wms.*\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "wms",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(honua_http_request_total{status_code=~\"4..\", endpoint=~\".*/wfs.*\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "wfs",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(honua_http_request_total{status_code=~\"4..\", endpoint=~\".*/wmts.*\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "wmts",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(honua_http_request_total{status_code=~\"4..\", endpoint=~\".*/wcs.*\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "wcs",
          "refId": "D"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(honua_http_request_total{status_code=~\"4..\", endpoint=~\".*/stac.*\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "stac",
          "refId": "E"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(honua_http_request_total{status_code=~\"4..\", endpoint=~\".*/collections.*\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "ogcapi-features",
          "refId": "F"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(honua_http_request_total{status_code=~\"4..\", endpoint=~\".*/tiles.*\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "tiles",
          "refId": "G"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(honua_http_request_total{status_code=~\"4..\", endpoint=~\".*/api/.*\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "rest-api",
          "refId": "H"
        }
      ],
      "title": "4xx Rate by Protocol",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "5xx rate per protocol. Sustained non-zero values usually indicate server-side regressions, not client misuse.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "req/s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(honua_http_request_total{status_code=~\"5..\", endpoint=~\".*/wms.*\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "wms",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(honua_http_request_total{status_code=~\"5..\", endpoint=~\".*/wfs.*\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "wfs",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(honua_http_request_total{status_code=~\"5..\", endpoint=~\".*/wmts.*\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "wmts",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(honua_http_request_total{status_code=~\"5..\", endpoint=~\".*/wcs.*\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "wcs",
          "refId": "D"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(honua_http_request_total{status_code=~\"5..\", endpoint=~\".*/stac.*\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "stac",
          "refId": "E"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(honua_http_request_total{status_code=~\"5..\", endpoint=~\".*/collections.*\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "ogcapi-features",
          "refId": "F"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(honua_http_request_total{status_code=~\"5..\", endpoint=~\".*/tiles.*\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "tiles",
          "refId": "G"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(honua_http_request_total{status_code=~\"5..\", endpoint=~\".*/api/.*\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "rest-api",
          "refId": "H"
        }
      ],
      "title": "5xx Rate by Protocol",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Approximation derived from protocol classification: OGC classic (WMS/WFS/WMTS/WCS) emits OWS ExceptionReport XML, OGC API / STAC / REST emit RFC 7807 problem+json. A direct meter tagging the actually-emitted Content-Type on error responses would be more precise; see #1144.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "req/s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(honua_http_request_total{status_code=~\"[45]..\", endpoint=~\".*/(wms|wfs|wmts|wcs).*\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "ows-xml",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(honua_http_request_total{status_code=~\"[45]..\", endpoint=~\".*/(stac|collections|tiles|api/).*\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "problem+json",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Error Response Shape Distribution (inferred)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Top failing endpoints by 4xx+5xx rate over the last 5 minutes.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "req/s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(10, sum(rate(honua_http_request_total{status_code=~\"[45]..\"}[5m])) by (endpoint))",
          "legendFormat": "{{endpoint}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Top Failing Routes (timeseries)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Top failing endpoints aggregated as a table, with 4xx and 5xx broken out.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "displayMode": "auto"
          },
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "req/s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(20, sum(rate(honua_http_request_total{status_code=~\"4..\"}[5m])) by (endpoint))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "4xx",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "topk(20, sum(rate(honua_http_request_total{status_code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) by (endpoint))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "5xx",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Top Failing Routes (table)",
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Overall error percentage across all protocols. Helps spot global degradations distinct from per-protocol regressions.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(honua_http_request_total{status_code=~\"4..\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(honua_http_request_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "4xx %",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(honua_http_request_total{status_code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(honua_http_request_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "5xx %",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Overall Error Percentage",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Same view from the OTel ASP.NET Core instrumentation metric. Useful when route templates rather than raw endpoint strings are preferred.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "req/s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 26
      },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_response_status_code=~\"4..\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "4xx (otel)",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "5xx (otel)",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "OTel ASP.NET Core Errors (cross-check)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    }
  ],
